---
title: "Holidays"
order: 2
---

The holidays listed below have been established as the official holidays for the College. Normally, all administrative offices of the College will be closed on these days.

| **Date**                         | **Holiday**               |
| -------------------------------- | ------------------------- |
| Monday, September 7, 2026        | Labor Day                 |
| Thur.-Fri., November 26-27, 2026 | Thanksgiving Break        |
| Wed.-Thur., December 23-31, 2026 | Christmas Break           |
| Friday, January 1, 2027          | New Year’s Day            |
| Monday, May 31, 2027             | Memorial Day              |
| Friday, June 18, 2027            | Juneteenth Observed       |
| Monday, July 5, 2027             | Independence Day Observed |
